{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/082-nv-yue-ji-ming/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/082-nv-yue-ji-ming/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 女曰鷄鳴 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 女曰鷄鳴 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《女曰鷄鳴》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"082-nv-yue-ji-ming","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/082-nv-yue-ji-ming/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"082-nv-yue-ji-ming","title":"女曰鷄鳴","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","女曰鷄鳴"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"女曰鷄鳴","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"士曰昧旦","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"子興視夜","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"明星有爛","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"將翺將翔","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"弋鳧與鴈","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"弋言加之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"與子宜之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"宜言飲酒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"與子偕老","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"琴瑟在御","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"莫不静好","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"知子之來之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"雜佩以贈之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"知子之順之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"雜佩以問之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"知子之好之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"雜佩以報之","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"女曰鷄鳴，士曰昧旦。子興視夜，明星有爛。將翺將翔，弋鳧與鴈。弋言加之，與子宜之。宜言飲酒，與子偕老。琴瑟在御，莫不静好。知子之來之，雜佩以贈之。知子之順之，雜佩以問之。知子之好之，雜佩以報之。","targetNotes":"全篇总评、集释与标韵。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 99 / OEBPS/Text/chapter05_0001_0018.html。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评","text":"方玉潤論《女曰鷄鳴》為賢夫婦相警戒之辭，非《序》所謂陳古刺今；首章勉夫勤勞，次章宜家和樂，三章則佐夫以親賢樂善而成其德，可與《關雎》《葛覃》並觀。","notes":null}]}]}}}
